      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Illustrative belief [0.33, 0.33, 0.34] = uncertain; [0.05, 0.20, 0.75] = stronger Expert belief.\nA good SQL answer should update SQL evidence, not prove competence in every skill.\nLow uncertainty alone is not enough: require coverage and evaluate correctness.",
